{'symbol': 'FBHS', 'date': '2022-10-18 10:30:00', 'title': 'FIBERON AND HUTTIG BUILDING PRODUCTS ANNOUNCE PARTNERSHIP TO EXPAND DISTRIBUTION OF FIBERON OUTDOOR LIVING PRODUCTS', 'text': 'MAUMEE, OHIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HUTTIG BUILDING PRODUCTS, A WOODGRAIN COMPANY, ONE OF THE LARGEST DOMESTIC DISTRIBUTORS OF MILLWORK, BUILDING MATERIALS AND WOOD PRODUCTS, HAS ENTERED INTO A NEW DISTRIBUTION PARTNERSHIP WITH FIBERON, A LEADING MANUFACTURER OF COMPOSITE WOOD-ALTERNATIVE DECKING AND RAILING PRODUCTS.'}